        <tr><td>Lush (pool and beach bar)</td><td>Easygoing</td><td>A casual drink, either setting</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>Nothing here is required. Watching, relaxing, or floating with a drink in hand is just as much a part of the day as joining in.</p>

    <h2>Late afternoon: The Wet Spot</h2>
    <p>Pearl's version of the afternoon hot tub ritual happens at The Wet Spot, the resort's large jacuzzi bar. It runs from early afternoon well into the night, with its own swim-up bar and daybeds nearby. A good read on where the evening's headed, follow your own comfort level and communicate clearly as the mood shifts.</p>

    <h2>Evening: dinner and dress codes</h2>
